# Sample LSP Hover Request

File: lsp/examples/hover_request.oot

## Request

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 3,
  "method": "textDocument/hover",
  "params": {
    "textDocument": {
      "uri": "file:///home/user/project/main.oo",
      "text": "pub fn hello() -> String { return \"hi\"; }"
    },
    "position": { "line": 0, "character": 8 }
  }
}
```

## Expected response (shape)

Known symbol: `contents.kind` is `markdown`.
Unknown symbol: `result` is `null`.
Academy header is prepended only when it appears in the source before `pub fn`.
